{"id":"22080305","title":"Is resharper right about this code being unreachable?","body":"<p>Reshaper said the left hand side of <code>??</code> was never null even though its type is <code>int?</code></p>

<pre><code>        _savedMediaFileId = mediaFile.MediaFileId ?? _savedMediaFileId;
