<p>Here is where I can't find a solution. I need to relate each TerPixel * in the traceBodyPoints array to a Box2D b2Body which will be created and added to the physics world. In my library, each isolated body of pixels within a texture corresponds to a Box2D body. So, when an event happens that destroys a chunk of the terrain, I need to destroy the body associated the the destroyed pixels and retrace ONLY the altered bodies. This means I need a way to associate any given TerPixel * to a Box2D body *.</p>

