{"id":"26347938","title":"Implementations of the «syntax» flex using tools flex and bison","body":"<p>I'm having problems with the subject. I need to implement the syntax tools flex. For this I wrote Context-free grammar. Here is a sample of the kind of examples that I should be able to handle:</p>

<p>№1:</p>

<pre><code>Rname 0|1
