{String2} {return 1;}

{A} {return AP_A;}
{B} {return AP_B;}
{C} {return AP_C;}
{D} {return AP_D;}
{E} {return AP_E;}
%%
</code></pre>

<p>I have a file for flex as follows:</p>

<pre><code>%option noyywrap
