{"id":"36683546","title":"How do I embed/isolate JS components (Google Maps) in an Angular2 app?","body":"<p>While attempting to embed a Google Maps (API v3) widget inside an Angular2 app, I discovered that there's a click/drag error that disturbs me. </p>

