</code></pre>

<p>I did look through the archives and found a few related discussions but none that addressed this question specifically. Thanks for your help. Please excuse any incorrect use of syntax and I hope I explained things clearly enough for a newbie.</p>","answer_count":"1","comment_count":"0","creation_date":"2016-06-16 19:38:07.803 UTC","last_activity_date":"2016-07-19 09:35:34.167 UTC","last_edit_date":"2016-06-16 21:55:13 UTC","last_editor_display_name":"","last_editor_user_id":"4979197","owner_display_name":"","owner_user_id":"6475619","post_type_id":"1","score":"0","tags":"excel|odbc|ms-query","view_count":"612"}

